    int destination;
    int distance;
    Edge* next;
};

Explanation:

Represents a road from one location to another

destination → index of the connected node

distance → length of the road

next → pointer to the next road (linked list)

📌 Multiple edges are connected using a linked list, forming an adjacency list.

3️⃣ Node Structure (Location Representation)
