1️⃣3️⃣ Dijkstra’s Algorithm Implementation
int* City::dijkstra(int start)

Step-by-Step:

Create distance and visited arrays

Initialize distances to infinity

Mark start node distance as 0

Repeatedly select closest unvisited node

Relax edges (update distances)

## 📌 Custom implementation without STL.

Complexity:

Time: O(V²)

Space: O(V)

