* `id`
  → Unique identifier for the trip

* `riderId`
  → ID of the rider who requested the trip

* `driverId`
  → ID of the assigned driver (`-1` if none)

* `pickupLocation`
  → Starting location (city node ID)

* `dropoffLocation`
  → Destination location (city node ID)

