## 1️⃣2️⃣ assignDriver()

```cpp
void Trip::assignDriver(int driver) {
    if (state == REQUESTED) {
        driverId = driver;
        state = ASSIGNED;
    }
}
```

### Explanation:

* Driver can only be assigned if trip is in `REQUESTED` state
* Prevents invalid assignment

📌 First valid state transition.

---

## 1️⃣3️⃣ startTrip()

```cpp
void Trip::startTrip() {
    if (state == ASSIGNED) {
        state = ONGOING;
    }
}
```

